{"title":"2009 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 12A Problems\">2009 AMC 12A #5</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">2009 AMC 10A #11</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>One dimension of a cube is increased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, another is decreased by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the third is left unchanged. The volume of the new rectangular solid is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> less than that of the cube. What was the volume of the cube?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/5/d6588f4ef45697f209d2848f3b4f1ea725e3e00a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 27 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 64 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 125 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"403\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the original cube have edge length <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. Then its volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/7230920a133b86893c8f65665e5e7beb0797b70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^3$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />.\nThe new box has dimensions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/6/cc6873715a60ff7706da71b8cad30cead78b1ad3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/b/64be5731bafe97ab8fb5d0f9c52c1c5362f963d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />, hence its volume is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/6/f6633266f429c2ac3f51e06b2cad1f3f0c75bbea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-1)a(a+1) = a^3-a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"193\" height=\"19\" />. \nThe difference between the two volumes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. As we are given that the difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/8/53897e4b47f6049266b4bffcef91bc949385b5e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, and the volume of the original cube was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/f/07fc69fd1ddd5c84102694627703a1509cd6966d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3 = 125\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\text{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"133\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A\">2009 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2009 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_